            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كسر اللاعب ضلعا في المباراة. kasara al-lāʿib ḍilʿan fī al-mubārā. The player broke a rib in the match."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: أضلاع, aḍlāʿ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In geometry ضلع (ḍilʿ) is also the side of a triangle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ضلع (ḍilʿ) is built on the native Arabic root ḍ-l-ʿ, \"a rib; to be crooked\" (Lane). Lane links the rib to the sense of being bent."
            }
          ]
        },
